    faqs: [
      { q: "What does Guhyeshwari mean?", a: "It means mistress of the secret, a title reflecting the esoteric side of her worship in the Kathmandu valley." },
      { q: "Do all sources assign the knees to Guhyeshwari?", a: "No. Some compilations name other parts for this peeth, so the knees follow one tradition." },
    ],
