    faqs: [
      { q: "Why is a necklace named instead of a limb?", a: "Some traditions include ornaments among the items that fell. At Nandipur tradition records the necklace of Sati." },
      { q: "How is Nandikeshwar related to Nandi?", a: "Nandikeshwar is a name linked with Nandi, the bull attendant of Shiva, and is the Bhairava given for this peeth." },
    ],
